  "sourceTitle": "Oven Stew",
  "sourceText": "Oven Stew\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:46pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 pound Stew meat (up to 2)\n8 Potatoes (up to 10)\n1 lrg Onion\n5 lrg Carrots (up to 8)\n2 can Tomato soup\n3 tablespoons Parsley\n2 teaspoons Basil\nGarlic powder (to taste)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Chop all vegatables into bite size pieces. Put meat, vegetables, herbs, and soup in a large roaster. Add 3 cans of water. Cook at 300 F for 2-3 hours.",
